        "Description": "Greetings, 47.\r\rYour target tonight is the Red Border. A highly trained operation with connections across the globe. They are on the penultimate stage of their plan in Chongqing, taking over from Hush&apos;s research. \r\rYour first target is Filiberto Newbold, a security guard. Fun name.\rYour second is Shirong Dai. The leading researcher.\rThe next is Sherwin Kung, head of operations.\rThe fourth is Dean Zirko, friend and guard to Sherwin.\rThe last is Virgilio Nelms.\r\rYou must NOT be seen at all, 47.",
